{
  "_doc": "Shared signing test vectors. canonical = METHOD\\nROUTE\\nQUERY\\nTIMESTAMP\\nNONCE\\nsha256hex(body); signature = hex(HMAC-SHA256(secret, canonical)). ROUTE is the WP REST route without /wp-json. QUERY: params except rest_route, keys sorted bytewise asc, rawurlencode(k)=rawurlencode(v) joined by &. Read by PHP (plugin), JS (tenant). Never use this secret anywhere real.",
